@format 1
@id queue.add-work
@title Add work to schedule
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary Persist built work records as pending items, return the accepted subset, lock its source cohort, and notify schedule observers.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.claim-work
@tag queue
@tag persistence

@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule
@alias store = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScheduleStore
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier
@alias plan = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LRelayPlan
@alias planstore = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LRelayPlanStore
@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] Built work items arrive <input>
- Receive work items with optional relay source and target identifiers @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> relay

[relay] Resolve batch routing <decision>
- Check each cohort for an existing durable plan before inspecting the mutable live route @ planstore.LRelayPlanRead(...)
? "Batch already has a saved plan" > normalize
? "No target or Finish target" > direct
? "Live target starts a new route" > snapshot

[normalize] Reuse stable stage identities <process>
- Resolve the requested source from either its stable-stage or original-tab identity @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
- Prefer the saved source stage's next stage, then a matching saved target stage, then the requested target @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
- Put the resolved stable source and target identities on every item in the cohort @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> prepare

[direct] Preserve direct routing <process>
- Put the requested empty or Finish target and source identity on every item in the cohort @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> prepare

[snapshot] Capture the complete route <process>
- Clone every reachable stage's layout, processing, output, automatic, and Funnel routing settings @ plan.LRelayPlanCreate(...)
- Replace temporary destination-tab GUIDs with stable stage IDs @ plan.LRelayPlanCreate(...)
> plan-save

[plan-save] Save before queue insertion <decision>
- Atomically save the captured plan in the active workspace @ planstore.LRelayPlanSave(...)
? "Plan saved" > stable-entry
? "Plan missing or save failed" > legacy

[stable-entry] Assign saved-plan entry <process>
- Put the saved entry-stage ID and requested source identity on every immediate item @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> prepare

[legacy] Retain compatible live routing <process>
- Put the requested live target and source identities on every item when capture or persistence fails @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> prepare

[prepare] Prepare each record <process>
- Preserve relay identities already assigned by the courier; only non-empty direct arguments override them @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
- Resolve lineage when it has not already been assigned @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
- Convert the work item to its persistent record @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
> save

[save] Persist pending work <decision>
- Save the record in the scheduled depot folder @ store.LScheduleRecordSave(...)
? "Record save succeeds" > collect
? "Record save fails" > skipped

[collect] Publish pending item <process>
- Add the item to the accepted subset and observable in-memory schedule @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
> result

[skipped] Skip unsaved item <error>
- Record that the item could not be filed and omit it from the accepted subset @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
= The unsaved item is absent from the schedule.

[result] Schedule changed <process>
- Notify schedule observers and return the accepted items when at least one record was added @ schedule.LScheduleAcceptedAdd(...)
> lock

[lock] Lock accepted source cohort <process>
- Collect each accepted item's source and Merge sources with its work batch ID @ courier.LCourierSourceLock(...)
- Mark matching source-list items locked, retain the batch as their relay cohort, rebuild grouped rows, and publish current-lock state @ list.PListPathsLock(...)
> locked

[locked] Accepted work is protected <output>
= Every successfully saved item is visible and claimable as pending work.
= Its matching live source rows are grouped by submitted batch and cannot be submitted or edited again until the list is cleared.
